# argv template (one token per line; '#' lines are comments): the PRE-REGISTERED reader in its real-run mode.  Its path (@READER@) is a PARAMETER of the chain (LIT1_READER); its sha256 must equal the reader_sha256 every
# launch-gate token binds.  --prereg-sha is the token-bound PREREG sha256; --orc-dir is the DAG-ORC reader directory whose Rig the reader imports unchanged.
@PY@
-I
@READER@
--manifest
@OUT@/runs.json
--out
@OUT@/read/LAUNCH_INTENT_READ.json
--prereg
@PREREG@
--prereg-sha
@PREREG_SHA@
--orc-dir
@ORCDIR@
